          <td class="News"><a title="GStreamer: a multimedia framework with a plugin-based architecture for a variety of platforms" href="https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/">gstreamer</a> &bull; <a href="https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/src/gstreamer/gstreamer-1.28.7.tar.xz">1.28.7</a></td>
